# Optional. Where the phone should find the API.
#  - iOS simulator: the default (http://localhost:4000) works.
#  - Android emulator: the default (http://10.0.2.2:4000) works.
#  - A REAL phone on the same Wi-Fi: use your computer's LAN address, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:4000
# Anything starting with EXPO_PUBLIC_ is baked into the app bundle: never put a secret here.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
